{"id":"663166","name":"碌鹅","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"","cover":"https://i8.meishichina.com/atta/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908095807276811138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p800","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鹅","amount":"半只（上庄）"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大葱","amount":"适量（缺，没放）"},{"name":"八角","amount":"适量（缺，没放）"},{"name":"草果","amount":"2个"},{"name":"桂皮","amount":"1小段"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"一只土鹅，取上庄来碌。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908138768322911138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"解冻,泡净血水,沥干水分。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908143490113611138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"辅料准备好，八角家里没有了，灵机一动，用五香粉代替。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908172603737411138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"铁锅烧热，小火。鹅皮朝下，微微煸黄鹅皮。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908176236492411138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"鹅煸出油来了。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908210927888511138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"趁热抹上老抽，腌十五分钟，用工具在鹅上插孔，好入味。孔","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908215085448811138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"铁锅烧开水，放入葱姜蒜，八角，桂皮，草果，冰糖。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908220972989411138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入腌好的鹅。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908238136098511138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":9,"desc":"放盐。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908242643242511138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":10,"desc":"放生抽。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908245477855211138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":11,"desc":"盖上盖子，小火碌。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908247265451411138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":12,"desc":"十分钟翻一次面。碌40分钟左右。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908252112062011138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":13,"desc":"出锅。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908258243791211138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":14,"desc":"用厨房剪刀剪成小块。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908260805296111138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":15,"desc":"碌汁烧开收汁。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908264540160311138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":16,"desc":"收好的汁。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908268432174211138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":17,"desc":"淋一些到碌鹅中。也可以蘸。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/09/20250209173908269987685111138610.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}